WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.664 --> 00:00:02.856
SECRETARY DeVOS, THANK YOU FOR

00:00:02.891 --> 00:00:04.062
JOINING US, DELIGHTED TO HAVE

00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:04.604
YOU HERE.

00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:05.726
&gt;&gt; Secretary DeVos: THANKS SO

00:00:05.728 --> 00:00:06.254
MUCH.

00:00:06.255 --> 00:00:07.724
&gt;&gt; Governor Huckabee: IT’S NOT

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:09.687
JUST K-12 EDUCATION THAT DEMANDS

00:00:09.689 --> 00:00:10.802
THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION’S

00:00:10.836 --> 00:00:12.873
ATTENTION, HIGHER EDUCATION HAS

00:00:12.874 --> 00:00:14.380
BECOME A BASTION OF SPEECH

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.464
CODES, CONSERVATIVE

00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:17.514
INTIMIDATION, AND MUCH WORSE.

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:19.705
TAKE THE UNIVERSITY OF SO MAIN,

00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:20.568
PLEASE, TAKE THEM.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.633
THEY ARE NOW ASKING COMMUNITY

00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:25.778
MEMBERS TO SIGN A BLACK LIVES

00:00:25.779 --> 00:00:26.799
MATTER STATEMENT AND ANTIRACISM

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:27.212
PLEDGE.

00:00:27.213 --> 00:00:29.257
WHAT’S WORSE, THE SCHOOL ALSO

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:31.138
PUBLISHED THE NAMES OF PEOPLE

00:00:31.172 --> 00:00:32.542
WHO SIGNED IT, WHICH IN THIS

00:00:32.543 --> 00:00:34.047
POLITICAL CLIMATE MEANS THAT

00:00:34.082 --> 00:00:36.492
THOSE WHO DON’T SIGN IT WILL

00:00:36.493 --> 00:00:37.681
ALMOST CERTAINLY FACE

00:00:37.716 --> 00:00:40.010
RETALIATION AND MAYBE EVEN HAVE

00:00:40.045 --> 00:00:43.164
MOMS SHOWING UP AT THEIR HOME.

00:00:43.198 --> 00:00:45.440
JOINING ME NOW, JOHN EASTMAN,

00:00:45.441 --> 00:00:46.533
CLAREMONT INSTITUTE SENIOR

00:00:46.535 --> 00:00:47.288
FELLOW AND CONSTITUTIONAL

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:47.808
SCHOLAR.

00:00:47.843 --> 00:00:49.267
THIS IS A PUBLIC

00:00:49.301 --> 00:00:49.621
UNIVERSITY.

00:00:49.622 --> 00:00:51.464
PEOPLE PAY TAXES AND THAT IS

00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:53.056
WHAT FUNDS THIS PLACE, AND THEY

00:00:53.057 --> 00:00:54.799
ARE BASICALLY THREATENING THE

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.091
STAFF INTO SIGNING A POLITICAL

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:56.968
DOCUMENT.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.288
IS THAT EVEN LEGAL?

00:00:59.289 --> 00:01:01.344
&gt;&gt; IT’S NOT LEGAL, IT’S NOT

00:01:01.345 --> 00:01:03.162
CONSTITUTIONAL, AND IT’S BEEN

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:04.498
THAT WAY FOR DECADES AND

00:01:04.532 --> 00:01:04.940
DECADES.

00:01:04.974 --> 00:01:06.881
THE SUPREME COURT A LONG TIME

00:01:06.882 --> 00:01:08.547
AGO IN A CASE DEALING WITH

00:01:08.548 --> 00:01:09.320
JEHOVAH’S WITNESSES, SAYING THE

00:01:09.321 --> 00:01:11.333
PLEDGE OF ALLEGIANCE, IT’S A

00:01:11.335 --> 00:01:12.794
VERY FAMOUS LINE IN

00:01:12.828 --> 00:01:14.313
SUPREME COURT JURISPRUDENCE, "IF

00:01:14.347 --> 00:01:19.636
THERE IS ANY FIXED STAR IN OUR

00:01:19.638 --> 00:01:21.949
CONSTITUTIONAL -- IT’S CANNOT

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:27.571
DESCRIBE WHAT CAN BE ORTHODOX IN

00:01:27.606 --> 00:01:29.407
POLITICS, RELIGION, OR FORCE

00:01:29.441 --> 00:01:30.785
CITIZENS," THIS IS A

00:01:30.786 --> 00:01:32.582
STANDARD OF FIRST AMENDMENT LAW,

00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:33.931
YOU CAN’T COMPEL PEOPLE TO TAKE

00:01:33.965 --> 00:01:35.679
PARTICULAR POSITION.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:39.365
WHEN YOU UNIVERSITY OR MORE

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:39.909
BROADLY.

00:01:39.943 --> 00:01:41.349
&gt;&gt; Governor Huckabee: SO JOHN,

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:43.488
SOMEBODY DOESN’T SIGN LESS, DO

00:01:43.489 --> 00:01:45.812
THEY SUE THE UNIVERSITY, AND HOW

00:01:45.813 --> 00:01:47.275
LONG DOES THAT TAKE TO WRAP

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:47.971
THROUGH THE COURTS?

00:01:47.972 --> 00:01:50.136
&gt;&gt; WELL, THAT’S GOING TO TAKE A

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.987
LONG TIME, BUT I WOULD BE

00:01:52.022 --> 00:01:54.031
CONCERNED IF THEY ARE FIRED, IF

00:01:54.065 --> 00:01:55.668
THEIR TERMS OF EMPLOYMENT ARE

00:01:55.703 --> 00:01:57.314
AFFECTED THEREBY, AND A LOOK, WE

00:01:57.315 --> 00:01:58.095
HAVE TO UNDERSTAND THE

00:01:58.096 --> 00:01:58.869
PROPAGANDA NATURE OF THIS.

00:01:58.871 --> 00:02:00.056
THE SAME THING HAPPENED SOME

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.582
YEARS AGO WITH THE SAFE SPACE

00:02:02.616 --> 00:02:04.201
MOVEMENT, WHERE FACULTY THAT

00:02:04.202 --> 00:02:05.457
WERE FULLY SUPPORTER OF THE

00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:07.194
HOMOSEXUAL RIGHTS AGENDA WOULD

00:02:07.195 --> 00:02:08.896
PUT SAFE SPACE STICKERS ON THEIR

00:02:08.897 --> 00:02:10.055
IMPLICATION, OF COURSE, WAS

00:02:10.089 --> 00:02:12.164
IF YOU DIDN’T GO ALONG WITH THAT

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:13.673
AGENDA AND PUT THAT STICKER UP,

00:02:13.707 --> 00:02:15.088
YOU ARE AN UNSAFE SPACE.

00:02:15.122 --> 00:02:16.833
THE SAME THING IS BEING SOUGHT

00:02:16.867 --> 00:02:18.720
HERE, IF YOU DON’T SIGN THIS

00:02:18.722 --> 00:02:20.668
ANTIRACIST PLEDGE -- WHICH IS

00:02:20.703 --> 00:02:22.249
ITSELF RACIST, YOU KNOW, THE

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.002
AUTHOR OF THE LANGUAGE OF THIS

00:02:24.003 --> 00:02:25.464
THING HAS ADMITTED HE WANTS TO

00:02:25.499 --> 00:02:26.271
REVERSE RACISM.

00:02:26.306 --> 00:02:28.148
IF YOU DON’T SIGN IT, BY

00:02:28.149 --> 00:02:29.995
DEFINITION, YOU ARE THE OPPOSITE

00:02:29.996 --> 00:02:31.104
OF ANTIRACIST, WHICH MUST BE

00:02:31.139 --> 00:02:31.671
RACIST.

00:02:31.705 --> 00:02:33.590
WHAT’S PURE PROPAGANDA, IT HAS

00:02:33.592 --> 00:02:35.270
NO PLACE IN AN INSTITUTE OF

00:02:35.271 --> 00:02:36.953
GOVERNMENTAL INSTITUTION, A

00:02:36.988 --> 00:02:37.816
PUBLIC UNIVERSITY.

00:02:37.817 --> 00:02:40.341
AT SOME POINT, WE HAVE TO QUIT

00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:41.934
CALLING THEM HIGHER EDUCATION,

00:02:41.969 --> 00:02:43.070
THAT IS BECOMING A CONTRADICTION

00:02:43.105 --> 00:02:43.501
IN TERMS.

00:02:43.535 --> 00:02:44.277
&gt;&gt; Governor Huckabee: THE

00:02:44.312 --> 00:02:45.617
PRESIDENT APPOINTS JUDGES, AND

00:02:45.618 --> 00:02:46.812
REGARDLESS OF WHO THE PRESIDENT

00:02:46.846 --> 00:02:47.295
IS.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:48.779
DO YOU THINK AMERICANS ARE

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.383
FINALLY BEGIN TO UNDERSTAND JUST

00:02:50.384 --> 00:02:51.743
HOW CRITICAL IT IS THAT WE HAVE

00:02:51.777 --> 00:02:54.343
A PRESIDENT THAT APPOINTS JUDGES

00:02:54.344 --> 00:02:55.892
WHO ACTUALLY HAVE READ AND

00:02:55.926 --> 00:02:57.180
BELIEVES IN THE CONSTITUTION?

00:02:57.214 --> 00:02:58.847
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK THAT’S RIGHT,

00:02:58.881 --> 00:03:00.140
AND WE SHOULD BE REALLY CLEAR

00:03:00.174 --> 00:03:00.743
HERE.

00:03:00.744 --> 00:03:02.980
PEOPLE ARE NOT CHEERING BECAUSE

00:03:02.981 --> 00:03:04.184
THIS PRESIDENT APPOINTED

00:03:04.218 --> 00:03:05.253
CONSERVATIVES OR LIBERALS TO

00:03:05.287 --> 00:03:07.655
ADVANCE AN UNCONSTITUTIONAL

00:03:07.657 --> 00:03:08.540
CONSERVATIVE AGENDA.

00:03:08.574 --> 00:03:09.654
INSTEAD OF AN UNCONSTITUTIONAL

00:03:09.655 --> 00:03:10.203
LIBERAL AGENDA.

00:03:10.204 --> 00:03:11.646
WHAT THEIR CHEERING IS THAT THIS

00:03:11.647 --> 00:03:12.397
PRESIDENT HAS APPOINTED PEOPLE

00:03:12.398 --> 00:03:14.689
WHO ARE FAITHFUL TO THE LANGUAGE

00:03:14.723 --> 00:03:16.162
OF THE CONSTITUTION, AS

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.203
ORIGINALLY UNDERSTOOD, AND KNOW

00:03:17.204 --> 00:03:19.301
THE LIMITS OF THEIR AUTHORITY

